caption: Relevant Governing Traits

Apply each governing-trait requirement where relevant to the Tradition. Preserve whether the rule requires both traits or offers alternatives; do not add an irrelevant Talent, Higher Purpose, Magery, Power Investiture, HT, or Will requirement. Wild Talent and other purchased ability frameworks are not governing Talents merely because of their names. Power Investiture follows the same Mastery progression as Magery: 3 at Tier 2 and 6 at Tier 3. Other unlisted governing traits retain their existing requirements pending an explicit standard for them.
